Hey [~accountid:5bb1cc64c9dad04734ea835a]\!

I’ve heard back from Perkbox. They are happy overall with the agreement however with two amends. 

1 - Bolt can give 7 days notice to cancel our agreement at any time. Means we can't bake you into our sales/marketing calendar. Too risky if you have a change of strategy, can we amend this? {color:#ff5630}I’d be happy to increase this to 30 days if we are? There isn’t a huge amount of liability we need to worry about and would allow us to get our affairs in order. Similarly happy to look at pushing them for 14 first? Is there anything we need to consider? {color}

2 -  Bolt do say that we cannot ‘sell the vouchers' for a higher price. Presume, if there is no margin for us, we are able to mark up via points. Are you happy with this? Initially we will sell at 50FP as with Uber, but we will will at some point have to increase both offers to 55FP {color:#ff5630}I was aware of this - for context FlexiPoints is their currency and because we aren’t willing to offer a commission they may need to increase the amount of their Points to cover the price of the vouchers. I don’t have a problem with this but checking with my esteemed legal colleague\! {color}

