{color:#36b37e}*Clause 7.7*{color}

# {color:#36b37e}Would it be wise to add one of the following wordings proposed by our property manager?{color}

{color:#36b37e}Option 1: Landlord shall do his best endeavours to find a tenant, which will rent premises as they are. {color}

{color:#36b37e}Option 2: The next tenant will demolish whatever he/she does not like.{color}

