{color:#36b37e}_‘Either Party may terminate the Agreement under the general terms of law, based on a breach by the counterparty which, due to its seriousness or consequences, makes the maintenance of the lease unenforceable.’_{color}

{color:#36b37e}Please may I ask{color}

